    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gaya: The Mystery</strong> is a Korean Souls-like action RPG set in the mysterious ancient era of Gaya.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is the result of one developer\u2019s long journey of passion and persistence. As a commander of Gaya, the player uncovers untold stories of history and faces unknown threats to protect the nation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blending real historical background with imaginative storytelling, this world reflects the developer\u2019s heartfelt desire to bring the forgotten tales of Korea to life through a modern game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The one who can change the fate of Gaya \u2014 is you.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gaya: The Mystery</strong> is a Korean Souls-like action RPG set in the mysterious ancient era of Gaya.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is the result of one developer\u2019s long journey of passion and persistence. As a commander of Gaya, the player uncovers untold stories of history and faces unknown threats to protect the nation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blending real historical background with imaginative storytelling, this world reflects the developer\u2019s heartfelt desire to bring the forgotten tales of Korea to life through a modern game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The one who can change the fate of Gaya \u2014 is you.</p>",
